# 4-Bit ALU Using Verilog HDL

## Overview
This project implements a 4-bit Arithmetic Logic Unit (ALU) using Verilog HDL.

## Operations Supported
- Addition
- Subtraction
- AND
- OR
- XOR
- NOT
- Left Shift
- Right Shift

## Tools Used
- Verilog HDL
- Icarus Verilog
- GTKWave

## Simulation
The design was verified using a Verilog testbench and waveform analysis.

